# Agent workflow

**Sources:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md); [package-first-simple.mdc](package-first-simple.mdc); [nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc](nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc); [tdd.mdc](tdd.mdc). Cite paths — do not paste bodies.

**Workflow:** Inspect before edits with `rg`; match existing patterns; keep diffs small; preserve UI unless asked; end with files, tests, and assumptions.

**Rule routing:** Playwright / claiming e2e → `e2e-verification.mdc`; PR style → `coderabbit-review.mdc`; SonarQube MCP → `sonarqube-review.mdc`; admin management screens → `admin-list-usability.mdc`; color/theme work → `ui-color-tokens.mdc`; time/date behavior → `dates-us-eastern.mdc`.

**Anti-stale:** Check [`package.json`](../../package.json) when API/library behavior matters. This is App Router on Node, **`standalone`** — not Pages Router defaults (`getServerSideProps`, `next/head` for new code). **`params` / `searchParams`:** async per AGENTS locale pattern.

**Current docs:** When changing framework/library behavior, check current docs through Context7 or official docs before relying on memory.

**Next.js:** Depth in `nextjs-node-server-2026.mdc`. Summary: RSC + server data unless client needs interactivity; no app-wide `force-dynamic`; Node runtime for Prisma/pg/FS; `revalidatePath` / tags after actions; optional `after()`.
